{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48191","headline":"别妻 · 陈季卿","name":"别妻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月斜寒露白，此夕去留心。\n酒至添愁饮，诗成和泪吟。\n离歌凄凤管，别鹤怨瑶琴。\n明夜相思处，秋风吹半衾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈季卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}